name quotchap
category Package
revision 56926
shortdesc Decorative chapter headings
longdesc A package for creating decorative chapter headings with
longdesc quotations. Uses graphical and coloured output and by default
longdesc needs the "Adobe standard font set" (as supported by psnfss).
